    throwing, and only [38;5;153mrequired[39m fails on empty input (so an optional field with a format rule passes when blank).
  - [1mThrow timing[0m said "where possible"; it now commits to attach time for both conditions, so a mis-wired page fails on
    load rather than on the user's first submit.
